; RiverMind Poker palette. Every pixel of the site's art is one of these colors,
; referred to by name in the sources. Ramps run dark to light.
; web/src/lib/art/palette.css is generated from this file, so the page's CSS
; colors and the art always agree.
;
; Ink and night
0c0d15 ; ink
171a28 ; night
222739 ; deep slate
30364d ; slate
454d6a ; dusk
69739a ; haze
a3aac6 ; mist
